<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GeoTel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GeoTel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Monday analyst Jim Wade had raised his rating for GeoTel Communications Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Littleton, Mass., software developer closed on Friday at 12-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
